# GitHub Linguist overrides
# See: https://github.com/github/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# Exclude from language statistics
dist/** linguist-generated
node_modules/** linguist-vendored
_archive/** linguist-vendored
*.min.js linguist-vendored

# Mark source code as documentation (if needed)
# *.md linguist-documentation

# Force detection of main languages
src/components/*.js linguist-detectable
src/*.html linguist-detectable
*.py linguist-detectable
